Tom: Yes. I really want to start my own business. I dream of running a small coffee shop.
Lucy: That''s brave. Where will you find the money to begin?
Tom: I''ve saved some, and I''ll ask the bank for a small loan.
Lucy: What do you think will be the biggest challenge?
Tom: Getting the first customers, I suppose. At the start it is always slow.
Lucy: Well, I believe in you. You have always worked hard.
Tom: Thanks, Lucy. If it goes well, maybe one day you can work with me!', 'Lucy 问 Tom 毕业后的打算;Tom 想自己创业、开一家小咖啡馆;启动资金来自积蓄和银行小额贷款;他认为最大的挑战是吸引最初的顾客;Lucy 表示支持;Tom 说如果顺利,也许 Lucy 将来能加入他。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"What does Tom want to do after graduating?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Start his own coffee shop.","Work at a big bank.","Travel around the world.","Become a teacher."]},{"q":"How will Tom get the money to begin?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["From selling his house.","From his savings and a bank loan.","From his parents only.","From the government."]},{"q":"What does Tom think will be the biggest challenge?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Getting the first customers.","Finding a good coffee bean.","Hiring a manager.","Paying the rent."]},{"q":"What is Lucy''s attitude to Tom''s plan?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["She thinks it is a silly idea.","She supports him and believes in him.","She wants him to give up.","She is not interested at all."]},{"q":"What does Tom suggest at the end?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Lucy should open her own shop.","Lucy should lend him money.","Lucy might work with him one day.","Lucy should study harder."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective4', 'U4', 'fltrp');
Girl: Hi, I''d like to open my first bank account. I''m starting university next month.
Clerk: Of course. I''d suggest an account with free online banking and no monthly fees.
Girl: That sounds perfect. I want to save a little money each week.
Clerk: Good idea. Even small savings grow over time and earn interest.
Girl: Should I get a credit card too?
Clerk: You can, but use it carefully and always pay your bill on time, or your credit score will fall.
Girl: Thank you. I''ll be careful not to go into debt.', '职员问能帮什么忙;女孩想开第一个银行账户,因为下月要上大学;职员建议办一个免月费、含免费网银的账户;女孩想每周存点钱;职员说小额储蓄会随时间增长并产生利息;关于信用卡,职员提醒要谨慎使用、按时还款,否则信用分会下降;女孩说会小心不让自己负债。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"Why does the girl want a bank account?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["She is about to start university.","She wants to buy a car.","She is moving abroad.","She lost her old card."]},{"q":"What kind of account does the clerk suggest?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["One that charges a high monthly fee.","One with free online banking and no fees.","One only for businesses.","One with no card at all."]},{"q":"What does the clerk say about small savings?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["They are a waste of time.","They must be spent at once.","They grow over time and earn interest.","They lose value quickly."]},{"q":"What advice is given about the credit card?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Never pay the bill at all.","Use it for everything daily.","Give it to a friend.","Pay the bill on time and use it carefully."]},{"q":"What does the girl want to avoid?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["Going into debt.","Saving any money.","Opening an account.","Talking to the clerk."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective4', 'U4', 'fltrp');
Seller: Twenty yuan a bunch. They were picked fresh this morning before sunrise.
Buyer: That''s why they smell so sweet. Where are they grown?
Seller: In a valley not far from here, where the roses grow wild.
Buyer: Wonderful. I''ll take three bunches for my shop.
Seller: Good choice. If you buy three, I''ll give you a small discount.
Buyer: Thank you. Do you sell them online as well?
Seller: Yes, you can order more on our website any time.', '买家觉得玫瑰很美,问价;卖家说一束二十元,今早日出前刚采的;买家明白了它们为何这么香,问产地;卖家说产自附近一个玫瑰野生生长的山谷;买家要买三束给自己店里;卖家说买三束给个小折扣;买家又问是否网上也卖;卖家说可随时在网站下单。', 'uk_female', '[{"q":"How much is one bunch of roses?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["Twelve yuan.","Two yuan.","Twenty yuan.","Thirty yuan."]},{"q":"When were the roses picked?","type":"choice","answer":"D","options":["Late in the evening.","At noon yesterday.","Two days ago.","Early in the morning, before sunrise."]},{"q":"Where are the roses grown?","type":"choice","answer":"A","options":["In a nearby valley.","In a big city.","On a high mountain top.","By the sea."]},{"q":"What does the seller offer for buying three bunches?","type":"choice","answer":"B","options":["A free vase.","A small discount.","Free delivery abroad.","A cup of coffee."]},{"q":"How else can the buyer order roses?","type":"choice","answer":"C","options":["By post only.","By visiting the valley.","Online, on the website.","Through a TV show."]}]'::jsonb, '[]'::jsonb, 'long', 'elective4', 'U4', 'fltrp');

